Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.72,0:00:06.05,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Mama... Mama...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.54,0:00:10.86,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.45,0:00:21.91,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Mama... Mama...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.70,0:00:24.68,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.56,0:00:27.50,Default,JIYOO,0,0,0,,Jina!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.04,0:00:29.60,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Mama...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.60,0:00:31.51,Default,JIYOO,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.99,0:00:35.99,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Mama... Don't leave me...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.99,0:00:38.47,Default,JIYOO,0,0,0,,I would never leave you behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.47,0:00:40.77,Default,JIYOO,0,0,0,,You and I will always be together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.07,0:00:43.37,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Mama...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.86,0:00:53.99,Default,COMET,0,0,0,,Jina.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.51,0:01:00.00,Default,COMET,0,0,0,,Setsu said their hands are tied right now, \Nso could you go check on the medical pod?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:01.09,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.09,0:01:04.26,Default,COMET,0,0,0,,Apparently, they're \Nsupposed to wake up soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.74,0:01:09.01,Default,COMET,0,0,0,,Um... you know. \NThat one passenger who was hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.01,0:01:10.74,Default,COMET,0,0,0,,Yuri... was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.17,0:01:13.64,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Maybe you should go instead of me, Comet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.09,0:01:16.71,Default,COMET,0,0,0,,Whoever goes will have to explain \Nwhat's going on with the ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.71,0:01:19.56,Default,COMET,0,0,0,,so a space traffic controller like you \Nwould be the better choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.02,0:01:21.08,Default,COMET,0,0,0,,Setsu's words, not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.82,0:01:23.10,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.08,0:03:00.00,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}EPISODE 12: ALLACOSIA
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.55,0:02:57.12,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Looks like the instant learning is complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.81,0:03:14.13,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Does your body feel okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.87,0:03:17.70,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.16,0:03:20.92,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Did you understand the instant learning?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.54,0:03:24.38,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,I see... I went back again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.94,0:03:26.43,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,"Went back"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.95,0:03:28.73,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Er, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.46,0:03:32.99,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,We're currently aboard the \NInterstellar Cruiser D.Q.O.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.99,0:03:36.62,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,But we're currently facing a huge problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.62,0:03:39.84,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Yeah. There are Gnosia \Ninfectees on board, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.25,0:03:41.06,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.06,0:03:43.79,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,And that's why we're about \Nto have a meeting, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.79,0:03:44.51,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.68,0:03:46.83,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Well, let's hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.43,0:03:56.28,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Did you also find out about the meeting \Nfrom the instant learning?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.28,0:03:58.30,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Huh? Er, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.40,0:04:03.43,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,What do you think it will be like?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.78,0:04:04.95,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Hm...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.39,0:04:09.60,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\an8}The meeting's purpose is to determine \Nwho the Gnosia infectees are, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.60,0:04:10.57,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.94,0:04:14.37,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,I heard that Gnosia infectees \Nhave no problem lying,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.37,0:04:18.14,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,so we'll have to use the meetings to \Nfigure out who isn't telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.05,0:04:20.77,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Or so I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.15,0:04:23.11,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.91,0:04:24.82,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Do you not want to?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.46,0:04:29.81,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,I... don't do well with meetings and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.81,0:04:32.39,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Like, actively exchanging \Nopinions with others.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.12,0:04:34.71,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,What do you think I should do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.16,0:04:39.32,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.32,0:04:41.48,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,It's not that I don't believe you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.48,0:04:45.98,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,but there currently exists the possibility \Nthat either you or I could be a Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.26,0:04:49.97,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,So we shouldn't try to coach each other \Noutside of the meetings.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.95,0:04:53.25,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.46,0:05:02.74,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,There's ten of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.74,0:05:05.22,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,And among those ten are the Gnosia infectees.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.59,0:05:08.46,Default,LEVI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Affirmative. There are two infectees.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.71,0:05:12.46,Default,RACIO,0,0,0,,So, how fares the amnesia?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.80,0:05:17.67,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,I seem to be doing a lot better now \Nthanks to the instant learning, Racio.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.05,0:05:19.03,Default,RACIO,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.03,0:05:22.17,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,All right, it looks like we're all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.17,0:05:24.98,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,Let's start the meeting. LeVi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.23,0:05:26.89,Default,LEVI,0,0,0,,{\i1}As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.13,0:05:32.78,Default,JONAS,0,0,0,,There appears to be one Engineer on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.35,0:05:36.11,Default,JONAS,0,0,0,,I believe this would be an opportune \Ntime to make yourself known.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.32,0:05:41.23,Default,CHIPIE,0,0,0,,And... silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.63,0:05:44.61,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,Well, there isn't much merit in making \Nyourself known the first day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.53,0:05:50.91,Default,OTOME,0,0,0,,But I think it'll be really hard to go forward \Nif we don't know who the Engineer is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.91,0:05:54.80,Default,RACIO,0,0,0,,To begin with, we might as well \Npress anyone who seems suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.14,0:05:59.81,Default,RACIO,0,0,0,,For example, a certain someone \Nwho may be feigning amnesia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.70,0:06:05.22,Default,CHIPIE,0,0,0,,I mean... anyone who tries to lead the \Nmeeting is pretty suspicious, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.22,0:06:07.89,Default,RACIO,0,0,0,,I see. This proves it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.89,0:06:11.64,Default,RACIO,0,0,0,,Yuri and Chipie are clearly \Ncollaborating with each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.23,0:06:13.72,Default,COMET,0,0,0,,You are?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.02,0:06:17.35,Default,CHIPIE,0,0,0,,No. I just said what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.70,0:06:20.73,Default,CHIPIE,0,0,0,,Though I guess there's no way \Nto prove otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.09,0:06:22.94,Default,STELLA,0,0,0,,What shall we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.94,0:06:26.44,Default,YURIKO,0,0,0,,This is foolish. We are merely wasting time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.75,0:06:27.97,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.97,0:06:32.37,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,At this rate, we're going to end up \Nchoosing someone without any basis.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.76,0:06:35.61,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,That may just be something \Nwe can't really help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.32,0:06:38.53,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Also, instead of words,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.53,0:06:41.10,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,paying attention to someone's \Nmannerisms and tone
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.10,0:06:43.59,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,can be an effective way to spot lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.59,0:06:46.62,Default,COMET,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think I'm better at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.62,0:06:48.73,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,What do you think, Jina?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.73,0:06:49.47,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.88,0:06:51.65,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,About what I just said.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.76,0:06:55.74,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,I think you're right, Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.15,0:06:59.32,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Sometimes, it's important \Nto go with your gut feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.39,0:07:03.24,Default,OTOME,0,0,0,,I agree with Jina!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.24,0:07:05.74,Default,LEVI,0,0,0,,{\i1}It is almost time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.20,0:07:07.78,Default,LEVI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who is the Gnosia?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.08,0:07:23.27,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.13,0:07:28.55,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,It's only natural for people to find \Nyou suspicious if you talk too much...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.32,0:07:31.53,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,but it's also not a good idea \Nto stay too quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.19,0:07:33.19,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.52,0:07:43.35,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,{\i1}What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.93,0:07:49.45,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,{\i1}No matter how much I rack my brain, \NI can't think of a good strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.96,0:07:55.24,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't imagine making it through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.05,0:07:57.29,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Maybe I should just...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.73,0:08:00.00,Default,OTOME,0,0,0,,Jina. Jina!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.51,0:08:04.50,Default,OTOME,0,0,0,,It's me, Otome. I wanted to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.81,0:08:07.22,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Okay. Just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.41,0:08:12.55,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.41,0:08:14.29,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Yu—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.52,0:08:16.60,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Yuri...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.12,0:08:21.15,Default,OTOME,0,0,0,,Oh, Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.67,0:08:24.16,Default,OTOME,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.56,0:08:26.99,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,You really don't mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.38,0:08:32.41,Default,OTOME,0,0,0,,It's okay! I can just tell her what \NI wanted to later, so please, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.67,0:08:34.94,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.66,0:08:36.61,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Thank you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.61,0:08:37.46,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.98,0:08:42.15,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,During the meeting... You decided \Nto include me in the conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.45,0:08:46.22,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,R-Right... No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.22,0:08:51.44,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Well, I must've sounded pretty \Ndismissive in the elevator, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.32,0:08:53.30,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.94,0:08:57.23,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,It's okay. It's not your fault, Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.75,0:08:58.77,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.77,0:09:01.22,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,What you said was right, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.09,0:09:03.31,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.29,0:09:06.19,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,You just keep saying "thank you."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.20,0:09:09.28,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.68,0:09:13.66,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Even now... Should we still \Nnot trust each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.99,0:09:16.27,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.97,0:09:21.08,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,There's still a chance that \None of us could be a Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.08,0:09:23.01,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.99,0:09:25.89,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.17,0:09:28.99,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Are we going to go out into space?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.82,0:09:30.76,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.51,0:09:33.22,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Er, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.70,0:09:35.07,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,How did you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.89,0:09:40.73,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.32,0:09:43.49,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,It's an organism called a Silver Key.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.95,0:09:48.22,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Because of its power, I've been looping \Nthe same period of time over and over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.15,0:09:53.24,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,So that's why you know so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.62,0:09:54.87,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.87,0:09:59.23,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,I've been to countless meetings \Nand voted countless times.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.23,0:10:01.87,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Did I... end up in cold sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.38,0:10:06.23,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Yeah. There were world lines \Nwhere that happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.23,0:10:09.38,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,But there were also times \Nwhere you made it to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.38,0:10:10.61,Default,Jina,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.61,0:10:15.02,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Sorry. I'm never sure if I should \Nkeep this a secret or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.87,0:10:17.76,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,What about a Gnosia?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.76,0:10:18.56,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.15,0:10:22.90,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Was I ever infected by the Gnosia?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.02,0:10:25.00,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.58,0:10:26.65,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.04,0:10:28.61,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Not just you, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.61,0:10:32.17,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,There were world lines where others, like \NSetsu or Racio, were infected by the Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.96,0:10:35.47,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,I've even been infected myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.64,0:10:38.54,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Did I lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.50,0:10:43.08,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,When I was a Gnosia... Did I lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.90,0:10:44.92,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.44,0:10:47.75,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,You said that we should go into space
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.75,0:10:50.66,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,to determine whether we \Ncould really trust each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.05,0:10:53.05,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,That's what you said to deceive me before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.29,0:10:58.38,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,But I'm talking about a Jina \Nfrom a different world line.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.38,0:11:03.92,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Not to mention, when you're infected by \Nthe Gnosia, it also affects you mentally.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.67,0:11:07.46,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,So that really does happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.13,0:11:08.93,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.82,0:11:13.53,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,When you're infected by the Gnosia, \Nyou gradually just become okay with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.91,0:11:17.42,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,With lying and deceiving people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.08,0:11:23.25,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,I don't want that to happen. \NI can't bear the thought of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.07,0:11:25.26,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Jina...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.04,0:11:29.80,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Yuri... Put me into cold sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.27,0:11:31.72,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.72,0:11:34.47,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Jina... Does that mean you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.41,0:11:42.00,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Tell everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.47,0:11:46.11,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,that you found one of the Gnosia infectees.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.39,0:11:49.40,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.07,0:11:54.29,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Just wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.38,0:12:01.21,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,So this is your home planet?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.68,0:12:02.53,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.00,0:12:06.99,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,It's far away from where \NI actually lived, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.61,0:12:08.89,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.64,0:12:12.10,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,I hate lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.54,0:12:13.35,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.88,0:12:16.44,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,I don't want to lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.94,0:12:18.83,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.36,0:12:23.49,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,But... before I realize it, \NI'm lying like it's second nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.85,0:12:25.48,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,When it comes down to it,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.48,0:12:30.18,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,I pretend to be human like the others, \Ndeceiving them without a second thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.74,0:12:33.53,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Even though... I hate that \Nmore than anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.74,0:12:35.83,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.62,0:12:39.12,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Because I've been a Gnosia before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.70,0:12:41.74,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Did you also lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.16,0:12:45.47,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Yeah. I lied like it was completely natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.76,0:12:48.92,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,I was trying to convince everyone \Nto believe that I was human.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.86,0:12:52.34,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,It felt like that was just \Nwhat I was supposed to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.84,0:12:55.22,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Then... why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.25,0:12:58.32,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,If you understand all of that,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.63,0:13:02.28,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,then just freeze me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.88,0:13:04.20,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.20,0:13:07.55,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,I don't want this. \NI hate deceiving everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.80,0:13:12.41,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,I don't want anyone to disappear \Nlike they're being cyberized.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.89,0:13:14.07,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Cyberized?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.00,0:13:18.07,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,I heard that was what it was like.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.86,0:13:21.07,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,People who are eliminated by the Gnosia
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.54,0:13:24.07,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.74,0:13:26.76,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,But only their souls remain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.33,0:13:30.57,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Cyberization...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.20,0:13:32.59,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Have you ever heard of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.01,0:13:34.45,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Just once.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.10,0:13:37.46,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,It's a technology that was \Ndeveloped some time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.85,0:13:41.45,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,The only known practitioners are the \Nshrine maidens from the Hoshibune.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.94,0:13:44.85,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,The Hoshibune... Wait, that's Yuriko's...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.70,0:13:46.92,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.92,0:13:49.68,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,The Hoshibune drifts through space, \Nand the shrine maidens on board
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.68,0:13:51.87,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,cyberize any believer who desires it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.41,0:13:56.24,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,They corrupt them, \Nturning them into something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.43,0:14:02.11,Default,JIYOO,0,0,0,,They relieve you of your body, \Nand you're freed from all earthly suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.43,0:14:05.17,Default,JIYOO,0,0,0,,You don't have to fear death anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.50,0:14:07.54,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,But you said you'd always be with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.54,0:14:11.17,Default,JIYOO,0,0,0,,And I will! I'll always be by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.17,0:14:12.67,Default,JIYOO,0,0,0,,Because I'll never die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.67,0:14:15.63,Default,JIYOO,0,0,0,,I'll be by your side... forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.31,0:14:19.39,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,So your mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.98,0:14:21.56,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,I never saw her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.26,0:14:25.40,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,I don't know what happened to her after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.23,0:14:31.44,Default,BRANCH LEADER,0,0,0,,Your mother's soul is up in Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.94,0:14:35.04,Default,BRANCH LEADER,0,0,0,,If you wish... you can join her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.55,0:14:40.49,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,I don't want to make anyone \Nelse disappear like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.58,0:14:44.61,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,I don't want to take away \Nanyone else's loved ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.01,0:14:47.48,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,If it comes down to that, I'd rather...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.48,0:14:50.18,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,What does the other Gnosia \Nhave to say about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.26,0:14:54.26,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.26,0:14:57.59,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,I'm sure you don't want to say anything \Nthat would rat out your comrade.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.99,0:15:01.34,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Why are you trying to help the Gnosia?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.34,0:15:02.60,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,You're human.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.93,0:15:08.85,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Yuri, you're supposed to eliminate \Nthe Gnosia and protect the humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.17,0:15:12.78,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,It's not that I want to help the Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.19,0:15:17.82,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,I want to help you, Jina.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.44,0:15:25.44,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,I'm going to give it all I have \Nto figure what you should do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.02,0:15:27.21,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Yuri...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.64,0:15:31.46,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,We're really high up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.50,0:15:34.75,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Jumping down...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.75,0:15:35.55,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.45,0:15:38.98,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,They say, when you're ready \Nto commit to a decision,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.98,0:15:41.62,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,you should treat it as seriously \Nas jumping down from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.36,0:15:44.04,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.39,0:15:47.23,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.41,0:15:59.78,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.59,0:16:08.57,Default,LEVI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Warp commencing in four, three, two, one...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.93,0:16:19.38,Default,OTOME,0,0,0,,The two of you were talking \Nfor a really long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.90,0:16:20.76,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.63,0:16:25.35,Default,OTOME,0,0,0,,Jina, who do you think we should eliminate?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.97,0:16:27.02,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.72,0:16:33.40,Default,OTOME,0,0,0,,I think... Yuri suspects us the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.10,0:16:44.47,Default,CHIPIE,0,0,0,,So, Racio was...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.19,0:16:48.42,Default,LEVI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Affirmative. I do not sense \NRacio's presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.91,0:16:53.17,Default,JONAS,0,0,0,,I trust you all understand this will continue \Nas long as there are Gnosia on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.56,0:16:56.66,Default,JONAS,0,0,0,,Surely, the time hath come for the Engineer \Nto make themselves known...eth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.00,0:16:57.91,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.37,0:17:01.19,Default,CHIPIE,0,0,0,,I'm the Engineer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.19,0:17:05.93,Default,CHIPIE,0,0,0,,I know my argument with Racio yesterday \Nmight make me seem like a Gnosia, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.31,0:17:08.66,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,Is there anyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.22,0:17:15.61,Default,OTOME,0,0,0,,{\an8}This is very strange. \NThere should only be one Engineer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.98,0:17:17.28,Default,CHIPIE,0,0,0,,So you as well...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.92,0:17:20.82,Default,COMET,0,0,0,,Does that mean one of them is a Gnosia?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.82,0:17:22.74,Default,CHIPIE,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess that's what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.78,0:17:26.70,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.22,0:17:28.67,Default,OTOME,0,0,0,,Jina...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.92,0:17:32.92,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,I'm... the real Engineer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.92,0:17:35.79,Default,CHIPIE,0,0,0,,N-Now, hold up. There's three?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.79,0:17:38.30,Default,JONAS,0,0,0,,Now things are getting interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.30,0:17:45.29,Default,STELLA,0,0,0,,But... wouldn't that mean two out \Nof these three must be Gnosia?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.64,0:17:47.92,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,That would be the natural conclusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.33,0:17:51.72,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,One of them is real, \Nand the other two are impostors.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.72,0:17:53.30,Default,OTOME,0,0,0,,Jina...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.40,0:17:57.51,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Well, for now, let's hear \Neach of their reports.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.51,0:17:59.31,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Who did you all investigate?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.77,0:18:01.78,Default,CHIPIE,0,0,0,,I checked Otome.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.78,0:18:04.28,Default,CHIPIE,0,0,0,,She's a Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.78,0:18:07.27,Default,OTOME,0,0,0,,I also did some investigating...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.68,0:18:10.41,Default,OTOME,0,0,0,,And Chipie is a Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.91,0:18:12.28,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,What about you, Jina?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.91,0:18:14.95,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,I checked Chipie...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.83,0:18:17.61,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,He's a Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.19,0:18:22.50,Default,JONA,0,0,0,,Two against one... Well, they \Nwould win if majority ruled.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.50,0:18:23.87,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,But that's not the case here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.55,0:18:27.32,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,Two out of the three are Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.42,0:18:32.87,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,There's no way that one Gnosia \Nwould report another Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.97,0:18:36.14,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,So the only answer that's \Nnot contradictory is...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.48,0:18:39.61,Default,COMET,0,0,0,,That Chipie is human?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.94,0:18:48.35,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Why did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.35,0:18:49.35,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.71,0:18:54.60,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,You should've known this would happen \Nif you said you were the Engineer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.26,0:18:56.40,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,And yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.95,0:18:58.12,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.60,0:19:00.77,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,I... just can't deal with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.25,0:19:03.61,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,I can't deal with becoming \Nsomething not human.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.47,0:19:05.69,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Jina.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.85,0:19:10.07,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.81,0:19:13.64,Default,LEVI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.64,0:19:16.14,Default,LEVI,0,0,0,,{\i1}The shields are down due to \Na magnetic field anomaly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.14,0:19:17.61,Default,COMET,0,0,0,,Wait, what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.61,0:19:21.40,Default,LEVI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please equip space suits as a precaution.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.22,0:19:23.58,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,The shields!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.42,0:19:26.27,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Jina!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.14,0:19:34.16,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,LeVi, can you tell us the \Nextent of the damage?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.39,0:19:40.08,Default,JONAS,0,0,0,,This ship has been my faithful companion \Nacross thousands of light years.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.45,0:19:43.06,Default,JONAS,0,0,0,,She will not sink so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.49,0:19:45.87,Default,LEVI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Receiving transmission from outside the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.29,0:19:49.53,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,Jina...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.08,0:19:54.56,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Magnetic field anomalies \Nhappen often in this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.91,0:19:59.17,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,If they lower the ship's shields, \Nit can be sunk from impact with debris.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.06,0:20:03.56,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,I've carried out emergency repairs. \NThe maintenance drones can handle the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.05,0:20:08.49,Default,LEVI,0,0,0,,{\i1}But the maintenance drones will not operate \Nas long as there are Gnosia present.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.49,0:20:09.29,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,{\i1}There aren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.29,0:20:10.19,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.61,0:20:13.40,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,No Gnosia remain on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.52,0:20:16.65,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,{\i1}So, LeVi, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.18,0:20:19.23,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,Jina... you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.47,0:20:45.58,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Yuri...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.58,0:20:46.64,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.02,0:20:51.91,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,I won't let you go alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.41,0:20:54.63,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.03,0:21:00.21,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,I've always hated lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.20,0:21:03.65,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Both lying myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.76,0:21:06.01,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,and being lied to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.39,0:21:09.33,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,But this is the first time \Nit's made me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.88,0:21:12.17,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,I'm glad you said that, even if it's a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.55,0:21:13.80,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,It's not a lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.03,0:21:16.00,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.76,0:21:18.85,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,You're going to leave, Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.56,0:21:23.01,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,You can't stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.71,0:21:27.04,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.04,0:21:28.37,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.30,0:21:33.48,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,That's what I've come to realize.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.76,0:21:37.32,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Even then, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.32,0:21:40.27,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,I love you, Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.84,0:21:42.87,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Even if you're going to leave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.87,0:21:43.87,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,So..
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.10,0:21:55.57,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,Thank you... my beloved Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.87,0:22:10.41,Default,VOICE,0,0,0,,{\i1}Danger. Oxygen concentration decreasing. \NDanger. Oxygen concentration decreasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.34,0:22:19.73,Default,JINA,0,0,0,,I hope we can see each other again.

